            "review_title": "Review at Em Mời - Flavors Of Vietnam",
            "review_text": "ho duc trung\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat food, beautiful space, and fantastic service!\nMar 2025 • Solo\nI came here on a friend’s recommendation and had a fantastic dinner. The Spring Rolls were fresh and flavorful, but the real star was the Rice with Braised Hemibagrus Fish in Clay Pot. The fish was soft, rich, and packed with umami. The interior design was beautiful—traditional yet modern.\nWritten March 17, 2025",
